# Terms that must never appear in this public repo.
# One per line, matched case-insensitively. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Copy this file to .release-denylist (gitignored) and replace the placeholders
# with your own: the company running the system, its people, its customers and
# deals, and the competitors you actually track. Every company shown in this
# repo is invented, and this check is what keeps it that way.
your-company-name
a-colleague-name
a-customer-or-deal-name
a-competitor-you-actually-track
